@startuml
title Test #4: internal → internal（寄存器重命名）

object "Before" as ib {
  internalStore:
    $r0 = "value"
    $r1 = <unset>
}

object "After" as ia {
  internalStore:
    $r0 = "value" (unchanged)
    $r1 = "value"
}

ib ..> ia : executeMove(\n  from={kind:'internal', name:'$r0'}\n  to  ={kind:'internal', name:'$r1'}\n)

note right of ib
  **前置**
  internalStore.set('$r0', 'value')
  **关键**
  验证 $r0 保持原值
end note

note right of ia
  **验证（两条都必）**
  internalStore.get('$r0') === 'value' ✓
  internalStore.get('$r1') === 'value' ✓
end note

@enduml
